    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "千三百十五石二斗四升八合九勺七才　延享四卯年後改出高　（引高）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一三一五石二斗四升八合九勺七才（延享四年卯年以後の改出高）／（引高）は左に続く控除項目の見出し"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "The column prints 1,315.24897 koku, with the note beneath it reading \"yield newly surveyed after Enkyō 4\" (1747, a rabbit year). The figure is an addition, not a deduction: book page 333 (upper_p179_left) prints 本高 70,000 koku and 前々出高 10,499.82411 koku, and 70,000 + 10,499.82411 + 1,315.24897 = 81,815.07308, which is the 草高 printed there. The bracketed （引高） squeezed into the gutter at the left of this box heads the deduction that follows — the 8,942.45138 koku of waste ground — and does not label the 1,315.24897."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "引高"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p180_right.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:1901,1313,144,2063"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-nobeoka_upper_p180_right-03",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "八千九百四十二石四斗五升一合三勺八才　前々無地高侍屋鋪長屋地幷道代溝敷土手敷藪敷川欠石沙入　荒地高引"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "荒地高引 八九四二石四斗五升一合三勺八才（前々無地高・侍屋敷・長屋地并びに道代・溝敷・土手敷・藪敷・川欠・石砂入）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Waste-land deduction: 8,942.45138 koku. The two-column note lists what it covers — land long carried as untaxed, samurai residence lots, row-house plots and road allowances, ditch beds, embankment beds, thicket beds, river washouts, and ground buried under gravel and sand. Subtracting it from the 草高 of 81,815.07308 koku on book page 333 gives the 殘 of 72,872.6217 koku in the next column: 81,815.07308 − 8,942.45138 = 72,872.6217."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "荒地高引"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
