        "value": "正租高　現米二萬八千十石六升二合六勺〔五ヶ年平均　免三ツ四分九厘七毛〕"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "正租高 現米 二万八〇一〇石六升二合六勺（五ヶ年平均 免 三ツ四分九厘七毛）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Regular land tax: 28,010.0626 koku reckoned in actual rice, at a five-year average tax rate of 0.3497. The six components entered under 内 — four on this leaf, two on the facing one — sum to it exactly, and adding the 雜稅高 rice of 896.29525 koku on book page 335 gives the 合米 of 28,906.35785 koku printed there."
      },
      {
